{"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "cost", "ucas": "it(a: u32, b: u32, c: u32) = ((a & b) | (~a & c)) + a * b + c\ncost it", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "cost", "model": "gt1030", "total": 5, "operations": 7, "by_class": [{"class": "iadd", "count": 1, "each": 1, "cost": 1}], "fusions": [{"fusion": "lop3", "pattern": "bitwise logic of up to 3 inputs", "count": 1, "cost": 1, "saved": 3}, {"fusion": "imad", "pattern": "a*b + c", "count": 1, "cost": 3, "saved": 1}], "selects": [], "best_total": 5}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "cost of it under gt1030: 5 (7 operations, shared subterms counted once)\n  iadd             1 x 1     = 1\n  fused by the model (one instruction for several operations):\n    lop3             1 x 1     = 1  (bitwise logic of up to 3 inputs; saves 3)\n    imad             1 x 3     = 3  (a*b + c; saves 1)\n"}
{"id": 2, "ok": true, "cmd": "find", "ucas": "it(a: i32 in 0..1000, b: i32) = a / 7 + b\nfind it 1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "find", "points": 1024, "sampled": true, "type": "i32", "model": "gt1030", "peephole": [{"cost": 10, "expr": "i32(u32(a)/7) + b", "rewrite": "the signed division a/7 as u32 (its operands are never negative)", "holds_where": "a >= 0 (a in [0, 1000]: its range) and 7 >= 1 (7 in [7, 7]: a constant)", "derivation": "a / 7 on i32 truncates toward zero; with the dividend >= 0 and the divisor >= 1 the quotient is >= 0, so trunc(a/b) = floor(a/b)\n0 <= a, b < 2^31: as u32 they are the same numbers, and the unsigned quotient floor(a/b) (at most a < 2^31) converts back to i32 unchanged", "check": "sat"}], "implementations": []}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "find it: 1024 points (sampled; matches verified on the whole domain), computing in i32, costs from gt1030\n  rewrites the model prices lower (each derived, with what it holds under):\n  cost 10  i32(u32(a)/7) + b                        the signed division a/7 as u32 (its operands are never negative) (derived; checked by SAT)\n      holds where a >= 0 (a in [0, 1000]: its range) and 7 >= 1 (7 in [7, 7]: a constant)\n      a / 7 on i32 truncates toward zero; with the dividend >= 0 and the divisor >= 1 the quotient is >= 0, so trunc(a/b) = floor(a/b)\n      0 <= a, b < 2^31: as u32 they are the same numbers, and the unsigned quotient floor(a/b) (at most a < 2^31) converts back to i32 unchanged\n  nothing new up to cost 3 (term bank full)\n  [searched every term up to cost 3: 16384 distinct columns, bank full; 'more' continues]\n"}
{"id": 3, "ok": true, "cmd": "find", "ucas": "it(a: f32, b: f32) = a < b ? a : b\nfind it", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "find", "model": "gt1030", "rewrites": [{"cost": 1, "expr": "min(a, b)", "rewrite": "the select a < b ? a : b as min(a, b)", "holds_where": "neither compared value is NaN (GLSL leaves min and max undefined there; the select takes the second arm), and where they are zeros of opposite signs the zero's sign may differ (both allowed by Vulkan's default float controls, without SignedZeroInfNanPreserve)", "derivation": "the select takes a exactly where b is above it (a < b), and b otherwise; where they are equal both arms are the same value; floats other than NaN are ordered (with -0 = +0), so that is min(a, b) wherever no operand is NaN, up to the sign of a zero"}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "find it: rewrites by identities the model prices lower (cost 4 as written, under gt1030)\n  cost 1   min(a, b)                                the select a < b ? a : b as min(a, b) (derived)\n      holds where neither compared value is NaN (GLSL leaves min and max undefined there; the select takes the second arm), and where they are zeros of opposite signs the zero's sign may differ (both allowed by Vulkan's default float controls, without SignedZeroInfNanPreserve)\n      the select takes a exactly where b is above it (a < b), and b otherwise; where they are equal both arms are the same value; floats other than NaN are ordered (with -0 = +0), so that is min(a, b) wherever no operand is NaN, up to the sign of a zero\n"}
